# Get obfs4 bridges from https://bridges.torproject.org/ and paste them here,
# one per line, in the form:
# Bridge obfs4 <IP>:<PORT> <FINGERPRINT> cert=<CERT> iat-mode=0
# Save as config/bridges/obfs4.conf, then run:
#   ./install.sh --transport obfs4 --obfs4-bridges-file config/bridges/obfs4.conf
